{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong> is a single-player psychological horror game with elements of combat and fast paced gameplay. This game is based on and is a celebration of the YouTuber Flamingo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/23cfa75f76df45fa6b1b2da24d861b55.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows <i>Albert Aretz</i>. Albert enjoys creating YouTube videos and skating. However, he doesn't realize someone is watching every move he makes. Every second of every video is seen by this entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entity lives in permanent limbo, and is deeply connected spiritually to Albert. He is the embodiment of Albert's creativity and the deep problems that associate with said creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entity is deeply interested in any little persona Albert creates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will these decisions and imaginative choices come back to bite Albert? If so, how will they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is and more will be answered in <i><strong>MR. FLESH FLAM</strong></i>. Mic Drop Or Something</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/4226739cd5cf79d9db430a75f8047e81.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong>'s gameplay is primarily based around stealth, and strategy. The game forces the player to think quick during intense situations. And at other points of the game, you may be forced to search an area carefully whilst avoiding a threat. The gameplay may also include sections where the player can choose to fight back, which adds an extra element of control and combat to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong>'s overarching story is split up into episodes that will release overtime. Of course, this is very common nowadays. So, my way of making it easier on the player is once you own the game, you are promised these things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every future episode of the game</strong> will be available through only <strong>one purchase of the base game</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Updates to previous episodes</strong> that may include polishing, bug fixes, extra voice acting, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Occasional</i> <strong>Seasonal Updates</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these promises will be met with <strong>no extra cost</strong>, you buy the game once, and you will be able to see the whole story unfold over time. <strong>No DLC will be needed to complete the game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These episodes are split into <i><strong>chapters</strong></i>, so if you close the game, you can go back to the section, or 'chapter' you left off on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/af1a77649d3a7965e90e4bef214c943e.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The additional, quality of life features of MR. FLESH FLAM are listed below.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of <strong>achievements</strong> that encourage replaying certain episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets or <strong>easter eggs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These features and more create an immersive playing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, programming, 3d modelling, writing, and a majority of the music are created by williamdev.jpeg (thats me :D)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tracks from episode 1 were composed by wozhakai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any other minor credits are featured ingame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: <strong>NO</strong> generative AI was used, or will ever be used in the making of MR. FLESH FLAM or related projects.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Phew!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/b950dc450d18107ef131c7968d677013e9f88a77.jpg"},{"name":"Video Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/2f8aac8d1bbc0ed426330704e158590924148ec2.jpg"},{"name":"Close One","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/ae6f56d16eca341147f780056038bc8e276eef8c.jpg"},{"name":"Car Crash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/1ff947b77bead65397ea1e080bf14ca2de96253e.jpg"},{"name":"Loyal Customer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/adcbc1e5887b628f8cc749069ac3c8a7c87d0a98.jpg"},{"name":"Death By Strawberry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/b618777dbe15a266785ef6b4c58bc2b17c525aa9.jpg"},{"name":"Pacifist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/cef86766635ba9d550713b87d6defc354eb9885f.jpg"},{"name":"Guilty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/18b3a45e1d987c0380ebdd71fb69a5faaa3e4dd2.jpg"},{"name":"Slow and Painful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/f24467bdd6a61867372d0762db6deb1675b67764.jpg"},{"name":"Oh, Snap!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3943500/d760d70adfbfa915ba520a586eab9acd5e396a8b.jpg"}],"total":33},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3943500?t=1772876673","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/29db100d3cce8c0fb408801df0fd07128ab66769/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772876673","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/6e4fa175df70e83ac8d5e3ebc5338b590d1834c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772876673","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/6e4fa175df70e83ac8d5e3ebc5338b590d1834c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772876673","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong> is a single-player psychological horror game with elements of combat and fast paced gameplay. This game is based on and is a celebration of the YouTuber Flamingo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/23cfa75f76df45fa6b1b2da24d861b55.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game follows <i>Albert Aretz</i>. Albert enjoys creating YouTube videos and skating. However, he doesn't realize someone is watching every move he makes. Every second of every video is seen by this entity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entity lives in permanent limbo, and is deeply connected spiritually to Albert. He is the embodiment of Albert's creativity and the deep problems that associate with said creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entity is deeply interested in any little persona Albert creates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will these decisions and imaginative choices come back to bite Albert? If so, how will they?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of this is and more will be answered in <i><strong>MR. FLESH FLAM</strong></i>. Mic Drop Or Something</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/4226739cd5cf79d9db430a75f8047e81.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong>'s gameplay is primarily based around stealth, and strategy. The game forces the player to think quick during intense situations. And at other points of the game, you may be forced to search an area carefully whilst avoiding a threat. The gameplay may also include sections where the player can choose to fight back, which adds an extra element of control and combat to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>MR. FLESH FLAM</i></strong>'s overarching story is split up into episodes that will release overtime. Of course, this is very common nowadays. So, my way of making it easier on the player is once you own the game, you are promised these things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every future episode of the game</strong> will be available through only <strong>one purchase of the base game</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Updates to previous episodes</strong> that may include polishing, bug fixes, extra voice acting, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Occasional</i> <strong>Seasonal Updates</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of these promises will be met with <strong>no extra cost</strong>, you buy the game once, and you will be able to see the whole story unfold over time. <strong>No DLC will be needed to complete the game.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These episodes are split into <i><strong>chapters</strong></i>, so if you close the game, you can go back to the section, or 'chapter' you left off on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3943500/extras/af1a77649d3a7965e90e4bef214c943e.avif?t=1772876673\" width=1560 height=418 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The additional, quality of life features of MR. FLESH FLAM are listed below.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of <strong>achievements</strong> that encourage replaying certain episodes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets or <strong>easter eggs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice Acting</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Original Soundtrack</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These features and more create an immersive playing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All art, programming, 3d modelling, writing, and a majority of the music are created by williamdev.jpeg (thats me :D)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 tracks from episode 1 were composed by wozhakai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any other minor credits are featured ingame</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: <strong>NO</strong> generative AI was used, or will ever be used in the making of MR. FLESH FLAM or related projects.</i></p>","developers":["williamdev.jpeg"],"dlc":[4204380],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id